    "detail": {
      "id": 1350073,
      "name": "[Evelyn] Rogue Flames",
      "desc": "When Evelyn's <color=#FFFFFF>Quick Assist</color>, <color=#FFFFFF>Assist Follow-Up</color>, <color=#FFFFFF>EX Special Attack</color>, <color=#FFFFFF>Basic Attack: Garrote</color>, and <color=#FFFFFF>Chain Attack</color>'s heavy attacks hit enemies, they apply a <color=#FFFFFF>Burst</color> mark that lasts 8s. Repeated triggers reset the duration. When other squad members' attacks hit an enemy with a <color=#FFFFFF>Burst</color> mark, they deal an additional instance of <color=#FF5521>Fire DMG</color> equal to 370% of Evelyn's ATK and recover 20% of Evelyn's <color=#FFFFFF>Burning Embers</color>, once per 2s. After 3 instances of additional DMG are triggered, the enemy's <color=#FFFFFF>Burst</color> mark is removed.",
